# OpenShouter

- Kotlin + Compose + Hilt + Room/DataStore; package `org.openshouter` after Sprint 1
- minSdk 26, targetSdk 35; strings in `res/values/strings.xml` only
- No Google Play Services, Firebase, Play Core, or closed telemetry (ADR-0002)
- Geofences: `LocationManager` + in-process radius checks, never `play-services-location`
- Do not log notification text, phone numbers, contact names, or coordinates
- Task board: `BUILD_PLAN.md`; ADRs: `docs/adr/`; memory: `AGENT_MEMORY.md`
- Sequential schema lock before Parallel agents; composition roots stay small
- After every `/build` wrap-up or `/push`, refresh `docs/features/parity-matrix.md` and the IDE canvas `feature-parity-matrix.canvas.tsx` from shipped `examples/android/` code (Yes / Partial / No / Skip). Never leave the canvas stale vs BUILD_PLAN ✅ rows.
